---
config:
  theme: neo-dark
description: >-
  one representative architecture diagram in the neo-dark theme (neo family, dark): nested groups with
  icons and titles, the built-in icons, a text icon, a junction, plain,
  labelled, one- and two-headed edges and a group-to-group edge, laid out by
  compass; edges and arrowheads in lineColor, group borders dashed
---
architecture-beta
  title Order platform
  group cloud(cloud)[Cloud]
  group api(server)[API] in cloud
  group data(database)[Data] in cloud

  service gateway(internet)[Gateway]
  service web(server)[Web server] in api
  service worker(server)[Worker] in api
  service db(database)[Orders DB] in data
  service disk1(disk)[Backups] in data
  service ops "Ops console"
  junction hub in cloud

  gateway:R --> L:web
  web:B -[enqueue]- T:worker
  web:R -- L:hub
  hub:B -- T:db
  db:R <--> L:disk1
  worker{group}:R -[reads]-> L:db{group}
  ops:T -- B:gateway
